  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gov Mozambique, 071001-171030Pungwe River Integrated Water Resources Managem II - Pungwe II monitoring</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gov Mozambique; 071001-171030 Pungwefloden vattenresursf&#xf6;rvaltning+utveckling II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att fr&#xe4;mja samarbete mellan Mozambique och        Zimbabwe f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad vattenresursf&#xf6;rvaltning i Pungwe-flodens      avrinningsomr&#xe5;de. St&#xf6;d ges f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka institutioner och system    samt f&#xf6;r att ta fram underlag f&#xf6;r utvecklingsorienterade              investeringar som ska minska fattigdom.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of PP2 is to strengthen relevant institutions,  stakeholders and systems at all appropriate levels for the joint,     integrated and sustainable management of water resources in the       Pungwe River Basin, and to stimulate and support appropriate          development-oriented investments in the basin that contribute to      poverty reduction and environmental sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201c;To strengthen relevant institutions, stakeholders and systems at all appropriate levels for the joint, integrated and sustainable management of water resources in the Pungwe River Basin, and to stimulate and support appropriate development-oriented investments in the basin that contribute to poverty reduction and environmental sustainability.&#x201d;.The extension phase 2014-2016 is structured into four main components:?Institutional development (with focus on Human resources and sustainability of institutions);?Poverty reduction;?Protection of the environment; and,?Regional Cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
